***************************************************************************
* Supervisory file for SOCSIM microsimulation for Sweden, 1950-2023
* Created on 23.10.2025
***************************************************************************
* This simulation uses as input age-specific fertility rates and
* age-specific probabilities of death (qx)  
* retrieved from the World Population Prospects 2024 
* converted into SOCSIM format.
***************************************************************************

segments  75
input_file presim

marriage_after_childbirth 1 
marriage_eval distribution
marriage_queues 1
hetfert 0
bint 12

***********************************************************************
* Pre-simulation (100 years) to get stable population at 31-12-1949
* Using WPP rates for 1950

duration 1200
include rates/Swedenfert1950
include rates/Swedenmort1950
run

* First simulation with actual fertility and mortality rates. 
* Give population at 31-12-1950

duration 12
include rates/Swedenfert1950
include rates/Swedenmort1950
run

duration 12
include rates/Swedenfert1951
include rates/Swedenmort1951
run

